Subject: URGENT ESCALATION: Mercator Vitals M-7 FW 2.18.3 Dose Error

Mercator Medical Safety Team,

Reporting a patient safety event caused by Mercator Vitals M-7
(FW 2.18.3). Firmware applied automatically at 23:47
on 2026-06-14 changed the dose preset unit from mcg/h to mg/h,
resulting in a 10-fold dose error (12.0 mg/h vs. 1.2 mcg/h prescribed).

Please provide:
1. Immediate Field Safety Notice
2. Confirmation of affected firmware versions
3. Technical root cause analysis

This will be reported to FDA under 21 CFR 803.50.

Dr. Kellerman
